      {
        "id": 87150,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-21T17:02:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"danmarshall14\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/danmarshall14/48/1944_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> danmarshall14:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>AA and Legacy definitely make one scary team.&nbsp; Double Galvanizing or Double Motivational Charging each round; sexy.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It gets much better than that. Argent Adept is capable of dealing 5 damage every round. Pair that with Legacy's Galvanize and Inspiring Presence, that 5 damage becomes 15.</p>",
